<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-WOMEN'S INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-WOMEN'S INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the Indira Gandhi</p>
<p>Gold Cup women's hockey tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>South Korea beat Russia 10-0 (halftime 5-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Soon Choi-mi (4, 49), Hee Kim-hyang (20, 27,</p>
<p>50), Young Lee-ji (24, 33, 52, 67), Choi Eun-kyung (42).</p>
</text>
